is continuous on \(\Psi^{3}\) by virtue of the continuity of the imbedding of \(H^{1}(\Omega)\) into \(L^{4}(\Omega)\) (cf. Theorem I.1.3). More precisely, we have:

\[|a_{1}(\phi;\psi,\chi)| \leqslant\|\,\Delta\phi\|_{0,\,\Omega}\|\,\mathbf{curl}\,\psi\|_{0, \,4,\,\Omega}\|\,\mathbf{curl}\,\chi\|_{0,\,4,\,\Omega}.\] \[\leqslant C_{1}\|\,\Delta\phi\|_{0,\,\Omega}\|\,\mathbf{curl}\, \psi\|_{1,\,\Omega}\|\,\mathbf{curl}\,\chi\|_{1,\,\Omega}.\]

